// SpatialInterfaceGeometryAttribute Observed area of the group route in the coordinate system of its reference frame. Room shapes are a MultiPolygon: polygons are separate parts, later rings of a polygon are holes (furniture, obstacles, unmapped floor). Islands and holes under 0.05 square metres are map noise and are dropped. The shape is cached from the last map read: observedAt says when, and a FRESH report only means the cache was returned now, so re-read the device state for a newer map.
